2.Using xml file -- [parallel testing]

Parallel Testing using Xml file
-----------------
1.Create Test Case
2.Created xml file to run the test case.
3.passed browser name parameter from xml file and received in setup() method
4.execute test case on chrome, edge, firefox (serial execution).
5.execute test case on chrome, edge, firefox (parallel execution).
5.If there is one thread count , execution is slow, then if there count is more, execution is fast. 

